{"page_content": "7\n\n.6.2 Derivation of input amount to hazardous waste incineration (Qmax) \u2013 regional scenario\n\nQmax,regional,HWincineration = 10,000 * 0.0876 * 1 = 876 [t/a]\n\n7.6.3 Derivation of release factors from hazardous waste incineration\n\nThe process of hazardous waste incineration is in principle the same as for municipal waste incineration, except that the operating temperatures are to be raised higher. Therefore the same release factors are used as for municipal waste incineration.\n\n7.6.4 Summary of information for HALS-1 in hazardous waste incineration\n\nTable R.18- 90: Information to estimate releases of HALS-1 in hazardous waste incineration processes", "metadata": {"doc_id": "e7a11cc0-0cd1-4fb0-a2cb-4444bab6f2bb", "content_type": "CompositeElement", "filename": "r18_v2_final_en.pdf"}}